{"id":1,"question":"Which document is filed first with SEBI for an IPO?","options":["DRHP","RHP","Final Prospectus","Abridged Prospectus"],"answer":"DRHP","hint":"Draft document","explanation":"DRHP is the first draft filed with SEBI for observations."},

